text = "[font_size=24]HOW TO PLAY[/font_size]

[color=yellow]STREAMER[/color]
- Fly with WASD. Drag the radar window over creatures.
- Keys [color=cyan]1-4[/color] switch radar filters.
- Aim at a target and read its [color=cyan]<x, y>[/color] numbers. 

[color=yellow]CHAT[/color]
- [color=cyan]!fire x y[/color] shoots a creature.
- [color=cyan]!laser x y[/color] closes a rift.
- At extraction, type the code [color=cyan]one character per message[/color].

Close the rifts, keep the ship alive, then extract."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

